WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.248
Lukas: Use ninety-nine point nine percent monthly availability.
使用每月百分之九十九点九的可用性目标。

2
00:00:04.248 --> 00:00:08.016
Raj: The error budget follows eligible checkout attempts.
错误预算以符合统计口径的结账尝试为基础。

3
00:00:08.016 --> 00:00:12.121
Raj: Just to confirm, correctness failures count too, right?
确认一下，正确性失败也计入，对吧？

4
00:00:12.121 --> 00:00:17.281
Hannah: Yes. A fast incorrect response isn't success.
是的，快速但错误的响应不算成功。

5
00:00:17.281 --> 00:00:20.761
Raj: I'll keep an eye on user-visible completion.
我会关注用户可见的业务完成。

6
00:00:20.761 --> 00:00:25.033
Lukas: Does your availability target cover payment-provider failures?
可用性目标包括支付提供方故障吗？

7
00:00:25.033 --> 00:00:30.457
Raj: Probably yes for customer outcomes. Attribute causes separately.
客户结果大概应该计入，原因另行归属。

8
00:00:30.457 --> 00:00:34.946
Raj: My working hypothesis needs agreed exclusions first.
我当前的假设需要先约定排除口径。

9
00:00:34.946 --> 00:00:40.514
Hannah: Okay, avoid hiding failures behind convenient exclusions.
好，不要用方便的排除条件掩盖失败。

10
00:00:40.514 --> 00:00:44.330
Raj: Just to recap, measure the whole checkout journey.
小结一下，要测量完整的结账过程。

